    "==Constituent Assembly got dual role: **constitution-making + legislative**==",
    "Crown lost **veto**; dominion till **Republic, 26 January 1950**",
    "Paramountcy lapsed: about **565** states; **Instrument of Accession** = defence, external affairs, communications",
    "**Kashmir** acceded **26 October 1947**; Hyderabad Standstill **November 1947**"
